7/deployment/self-hosted/overview#opciones-de-despliegue","content":"Hay dos formas de desplegar Lamassu on-prem:"},"304":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/deployment/self-hosted/overview-47","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/deployment/self-hosted/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/deployment/self-hosted/overview#1-despliegue-manual-con-helm","content":"Es la opción recomendada para entornos productivos o controlados, donde PostgreSQL, RabbitMQ, Keycloak, certificados y direccionamiento del Gateway ya están definidos por el equipo de plataforma."},"305":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/deployment/self-hosted/overview-48","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/deployment/self-hosted/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/deployment/self-hosted/overview#2-despliegue-automatizado-con-fastlane","content":"Es la opción más útil para pruebas, demos, CI o bootstrap rápido de un entorno. Fastlane levanta PostgreSQL, Keycloak, RabbitMQ y Lamassu en un único flujo. Su comportamiento está documentado en la página siguiente."},"306":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/deployment/self-hosted/overview-49","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/deployment/self-hosted/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/deployment/self-hosted/overview#arquitectura","content":"Lamassu IoT se despliega como un conjunto de microservicios Kubernetes independientes. El chart principal crea `Deployment`, `StatefulSet`, `Service`, `ConfigMap`, `HTTPRoute`, `Gateway`, certificados y recursos auxiliares según los valores definidos."},"307":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/deployment/self-hosted/overview-50","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/deployment/self-hosted/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/deployment/self-hosted/overview#arquitectura","content":"Dependencias externas requeridas por el chart principal:"},"308":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/deployment/self-hosted/overview-51","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/deployment/self-hosted/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/deployment/self-hosted/overview#arquitectura","content":"PostgreSQL"},"309":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/deployment/self-hosted/overview-52","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/deployment/self-hosted/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/deployment/self-hosted/overview#arquitectura","content":"RabbitMQ"},"310":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/deployment/self-hosted/overview-53","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/deployment/self-hosted/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/deployment/self-hosted/overview#arquitectura","content":"proveedor OIDC, típicamente Keycloak"},"311":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/deployment/self-hosted/overview-54","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/deployment/self-hosted/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/deployment/self-hosted/overview#arquitectura","content":"El chart no instala estas dependencias por sí solo. Para un despliegue manual hay que provisionarlas antes. Si se busca un entorno funcional rápido para laboratorio o validación, el script Fastlane sí instala PostgreSQL, RabbitMQ y Keycloak además del chart de Lamassu."},"312":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/deployment/self-hosted/overview-55","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/deployment/self-hosted/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/deployment/self-hosted/overview#instalación-manual-con-helm","content":"Agregar el repositorio Helm:"},"313":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/deployment/self-hosted/overview-56","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/deployment/self-hosted/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/deployment/self-hosted/overview#instalación-manual-con-helm","content":"O instalar desde una copia local del repositorio:"},"314":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/deployment/self-hosted/overview-57","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/deployment/self-hosted/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/deployment/self-hosted/overview#valores-mínimos-que-deben-definirse","content":"Los valores por defecto del chart son deliberadamente incompletos para dependencias externas. Como mínimo, un despliegue manual debe definir:"},"315":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/deployment/self-hosted/overview-58","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/deployment/self-hosted/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/deployment/self-hosted/overview#valores-mínimos-que-deben-definirse","content":"`postgres.hostname`, `postgres.username`, `postgres.password`"},"316":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/deployment/self-hosted/overview-59","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/deployment/self-hosted/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/deployment/self-hosted/overview#valores-mínimos-que-deben-definirse","content":"`amqp.hostname`, `amqp.username`, `amqp.password`"},"317":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/deployment/self-hosted/overview-60","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/deployment/self-hosted/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/deployment/self-hosted/overview#valores-mínimos-que-deben-definirse","content":"`auth.oidc.frontend.authority`"},"318":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/deployment/self-hosted/overview-61","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/deployment/self-hosted/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/deployment/self-hosted/overview#valores-mínimos-que-deben-definirse","content":"`auth.oidc.apiGateway.jwks`"},"319":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/deployment/self-hosted/overview-62","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/deployment/self-hosted/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/deployment/self-hosted/overview#valores-mínimos-que-deben-definirse","content":"`services.authz.jwkUrl` y un principal de bootstrap que coincida con un administrador real"},"320":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/deployment/self-hosted/overview-63","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/deployment/self-hosted/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/deployment/self-hosted/overview#valores-mínimos-que-deben-definirse","content":"`services.ca.domains`"},"321":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/deployment/self-hosted/overview-64","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/deployment/self-hosted/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/deployment/self-hosted/overview#valores-mínimos-que-deben-definirse","content":"`gateway.addresses` o una estrategia equivalente de publicación según el clúster"},"322":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/deployment/self-hosted/overview-65","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/deployment/self-hosted/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/deployment/self-hosted/overview#valores-mínimos-que-deben-definirse","content":"`tls.*` según se use `certManager` o certificado externo"},"323":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/deployment/self-hosted/overview-66","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/deployment/self-hosted/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/deployment/self-hosted/overview#valores-mínimos-que-deben-definirse","content":"Ejemplo base:"},"324":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/deployment/self-hosted/overview-67","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/deployment/self-hosted/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/deployment/self-hosted/overview#provisiona-el-primer-administrador","content":"No hay un superusuario implícito. Antes de instalar, crea el rol `pki-admin` en el proveedor OIDC y asígnalo al grupo que administrará Lamassu. El principal del ejemplo concede la política `SUPER ADMIN` a cualquier token que contenga ese rol."},"325":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/deployment/self-hosted/overview-68","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/deployment/self-hosted/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/deployment/self-hosted/overview#provisiona-el-primer-administrador","content":"El Job `pre-install` y `pre-upgrade` prepara las bases de datos, ejecuta las migraciones de authz, precarga las políticas y aplica `services.authz.bootstrap` antes de que arranquen los Deployments. El bootstrap es idempotente: conserva los principales existentes y añade únicamente los grants que falten."},"326":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/deployment/self-hosted/overview-69","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/deployment/self-hosted/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/deployment/self-hosted/overview#provisiona-el-primer-administrador","content":"Si ningún token coincide con un principal activo, nadie podrá administrar la PKI. Prueba una identidad autorizada y otra denegada, y conserva un procedimiento de recuperación."},"327":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/deployment/self-hosted/overview-70","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/deployment/self-hosted/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/deployment/self-hosted/overview#provisiona-el-primer-administrador","content":"Consulta Control de acceso para diseñar principales y políticas."},"328":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/deployment/self-hosted/overview-71","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/deployment/self-hosted/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/deployment/self-hosted/overview#áreas-de-configuración-más-relevantes","content":"**TLS:** `tls.type`, `tls.certManagerOptions.*` y `tls.externalOptions.secretName` controlan el certificado *downstream* del Gateway."},"329":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/deployment/self-hosted/overview-72","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/deployment/self-hosted/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/deployment/self-hosted/overview#áreas-de-configuración-más-relevantes","content":"**Gateway:** `gateway.addresses`, `gateway.ports.*` y `gateway.extraRouting` publican la UI y las APIs mediante Envoy Gateway."},"330":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/deployment/self-hosted/overview-73","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/deployment/self-hosted/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/deployment/self-hosted/overview#áreas-de-configuración-más-relevantes","content":"**Persistencia:** `postgres.*` define la conexión a PostgreSQL."},"331":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/deployment/self-hosted/overview-74","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/deployment/self-hosted/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/deployment/self-hosted/overview#áreas-de-configuración-más-relevantes","content":"**Mensajería:** `amqp.*` configura la conexión a RabbitMQ."},"332":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/deployment/self-hosted/overview-75","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/deployment/self-hosted/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/deployment/self-hosted/overview#áreas-de-configuración-más-relevantes","content":"**Identidad y autorización:** `auth.oidc.*`, `services.authz.jwkUrl` y `services.authz.bootstrap` configuran login, validación JWT y permisos iniciales."},"333":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/deployment/self-hosted/overview-76","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/deployment/self-hosted/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/deployment/self-hosted/overview#áreas-de-configuración-más-relevantes","content":"**Autoridades:** `services.ca.domains` establece los dominios autorizados para CA y certificados."},"334":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/deployment/self-hosted/overview-77","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/deployment/self-hosted/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/deployment/self-hosted/overview#áreas-de-configuración-más-relevantes","content":"**Claves:** `services.kms.cryptoEngines.*` configura los motores criptográficos y su almacenamiento."},"335":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/deployment/self-hosted/overview-78","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/deployment/self-hosted/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/deployment/self-hosted/overview#áreas-de-configuración-más-relevantes","content":"**Alertas:** `services.alerts.smtp_server.*` prepara el envío de correo."},"336":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/deployment/self-hosted/overview-79","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/deployment/self-hosted/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/deployment/self-hosted/overview#verificación-del-despliegue","content":"El chart incluye una prueba Helm en `charts/lamassu/templates/tests/test-connections.yml`. Tras instalarlo, puede validarse con:"},"337":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/deployment/self-hosted/overview-80","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/deployment/self-hosted/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/deployment/self-hosted/overview#verificación-del-despliegue","content":"La prueba comprueba al menos:"},"338":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/deployment/self-hosted/overview-81","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/deployment/self-hosted/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/deployment/self-hosted/overview#verificación-del-despliegue","content":"salud de `ca`"},"339":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/deployment/self-hosted/overview-82","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/deployment/self-hosted/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/deployment/self-hosted/overview#verificación-del-despliegue","content":"salud de `dms-manager`"},"340":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/deployment/self-hosted/overview-83","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/deployment/self-hosted/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/deployment/self-hosted/overview#verificación-del-despliegue","content":"salud de `device-manager`"},"341":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/deployment/self-hosted/overview-84","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/deployment/self-hosted/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/deployment/self-hosted/overview#verificación-del-despliegue","content":"salud de `va`"},"342":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/deployment/self-hosted/overview-85","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/deployment/self-hosted/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/deployment/self-hosted/overview#verificación-del-despliegue","content":"respuesta HTML esperada del servicio `ui`"},"343":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/deployment/self-hosted/overview-86","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/deployment/self-hosted/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/deployment/self-hosted/overview#repositorio-helm","content":"El repositorio `lamassu-helm` está organizado en tres bloques principales:"},"344":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/deployment/self-hosted/overview-87","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/deployment/self-hosted/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/deployment/self-hosted/overview#repositorio-helm","content":"`charts/lamassu`: chart principal de Lamassu"},"345":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/deployment/self-hosted/overview-88","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/deployment/self-hosted/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/deployment/self-hosted/overview#repositorio-helm","content":"`charts/softhsm`: chart opcional para laboratorios o escenarios de integración con PKCS#11 emulado"},"346":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/deployment/self-hosted/overview-89","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/deployment/self-hosted/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/deployment/self-hosted/overview#repositorio-helm","content":"`scripts/lamassu-fast-lane.sh`: automatización para levantar dependencias y desplegar Lamassu con intervención mínima"},"347":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/deployment/self-hosted/overview-90","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/deployment/self-hosted/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/deployment/self-hosted/overview#softhsm-como-complemento-opcional","content":"El chart `charts/softhsm` no forma parte del despliegue estándar, pero resulta útil en entornos de laboratorio cuando se necesita simular un HSM compatible con PKCS#11. No sustituye al backend KMS principal; sirve como soporte para pruebas o integraciones concretas."},"348":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/deployment/self-hosted/overview-91","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/deployment/self-hosted/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/deployment/self-hosted/overview#versionado-y-migraciones","content":"La versión actual del chart en el repositorio es `3.8.0`. Para upgrades entre versiones, consulta las guías de `charts/lamassu/CHANGELOG/` y revisa especialmente las migraciones de base de datos y el bootstrap de authz."},"349":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/platform/pki/access-control","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/platform/pki/access-control","type":"page","content":"Control de acceso","breadcrumbs":["Docs","Plataforma","Administrar Lamassu"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/platform/pki/access-control"},"350":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/platform/pki/access-control-0","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/platform/pki/access-control","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/platform/pki/access-control","content":"Diseña quién puede acceder a Lamassu mediante principales, políticas, permisos sobre recursos y autorización de rutas HTTP."},"351":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/platform/pki/access-control-1","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/platform/pki/access-control","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/platform/pki/access-control#conceptos-esenciales","content":"Conceptos esenciales"},"352":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/platform/pki/access-control-2","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/platform/pki/access-control","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/platform/pki/access-control#dos-sistemas-de-decisión","content":"Dos sistemas de decisión"},"353":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/platform/pki/access-control-3","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/platform/pki/access-control","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/platform