"tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/platform/pki/device-enrollment","content":"Cada DMS es un límite operativo independiente: puede representar una línea de producto, un entorno o un tipo de dispositivo con su propia CA, reglas de autenticación, confianza distribuida y ventana de renovación."},"998":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/platform/pki/device-enrollment-13","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/platform/pki/device-enrollment","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/platform/pki/device-enrollment#antes-de-empezar","content":"Crea o importa al menos una CA activa."},"999":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/platform/pki/device-enrollment-14","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/platform/pki/device-enrollment","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/platform/pki/device-enrollment#antes-de-empezar","content":"Decide cómo se autenticarán los dispositivos durante el primer enrolamiento."},"1000":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/platform/pki/device-enrollment-15","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/platform/pki/device-enrollment","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/platform/pki/device-enrollment#antes-de-empezar","content":"Define qué autoridades debe recibir el dispositivo como anclas de confianza."},"1001":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/platform/pki/device-enrollment-16","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/platform/pki/device-enrollment","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/platform/pki/device-enrollment#antes-de-empezar","content":"Asegúrate de tener permisos para administrar DMS."},"1002":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/platform/pki/device-enrollment-17","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/platform/pki/device-enrollment","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/platform/pki/device-enrollment#identifica-la-flota","content":"Asigna al DMS un nombre que describa su alcance, por ejemplo una familia de dispositivos o un entorno."},"1003":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/platform/pki/device-enrollment-18","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/platform/pki/device-enrollment","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/platform/pki/device-enrollment#selecciona-la-ca-de-enrolamiento","content":"Elige la autoridad que emitirá las identidades. Su política y periodo de validez condicionan los certificados que podrá obtener la flota."},"1004":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/platform/pki/device-enrollment-19","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/platform/pki/device-enrollment","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/platform/pki/device-enrollment#configura-est","content":"Define la autenticación de `enroll`, la política de `reenroll`, la ventana de renovación y, si se necesita, `serverkeygen`."},"1005":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/platform/pki/device-enrollment-20","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/platform/pki/device-enrollment","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/platform/pki/device-enrollment#distribuye-la-confianza","content":"Configura **CA Distribution** para controlar la respuesta del endpoint `cacerts`."},"1006":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/platform/pki/device-enrollment-21","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/platform/pki/device-enrollment","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/platform/pki/device-enrollment#verifica-los-endpoints","content":"Desde el menú del DMS, abre &#x2A;*EST (RFC-7030)** y comprueba la URL base y los ejemplos de invocación antes de integrar el firmware."},"1007":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/platform/pki/device-enrollment-22","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/platform/pki/device-enrollment","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/platform/pki/device-enrollment#distribución-de-confianza","content":"**Include Lamassu System CA** distribuye el certificado TLS del servidor Lamassu, útil para *pinning*. No representa una CA de emisión."},"1008":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/platform/pki/device-enrollment-23","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/platform/pki/device-enrollment","tags":[],"