atform/pki/est-enrollment#códigos-de-error-y-diagnóstico","content":"Revisar los logs del servicio webhook."},"1295":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/platform/pki/est-enrollment-234","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/platform/pki/est-enrollment","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/platform/pki/est-enrollment#códigos-de-error-y-diagnóstico","content":"500"},"1296":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/platform/pki/est-enrollment-235","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/platform/pki/est-enrollment","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/platform/pki/est-enrollment#códigos-de-error-y-diagnóstico","content":"`server key generation not enabled`"},"1297":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/platform/pki/est-enrollment-236","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/platform/pki/est-enrollment","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/platform/pki/est-enrollment#códigos-de-error-y-diagnóstico","content":"`/serverkeygen` está deshabilitado en el DMS."},"1298":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/platform/pki/est-enrollment-237","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/platform/pki/est-enrollment","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/platform/pki/est-enrollment#códigos-de-error-y-diagnóstico","content":"Pedir al administrador activar `ServerKeyGen.Enabled`."},"1299":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/platform/pki/est-enrollment-238","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/platform/pki/est-enrollment","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/platform/pki/est-enrollment#códigos-de-error-y-diagnóstico","content":"Para los mensajes que no figuren en esta tabla, los logs del servidor Lamassu (con los campos `func`, `dms`, `device-cn`, `step`, `auth-method`, `auth-status`) son el primer lugar donde buscar la causa."},"1300":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/platform/pki/est-enrollment-239","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/platform/pki/est-enrollment","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/platform/pki/est-enrollment#notas-de-compatibilidad","content":"La implementación de Lamassu se ajusta al RFC 7030 en lo esencial pero introduce varias particularidades que pueden afectar a clientes EST estrictos o a librerías de terceros:"},"1301":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/platform/pki/est-enrollment-240","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/platform/pki/est-enrollment","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/platform/pki/est-enrollment#notas-de-compatibilidad","content":"Los endpoints `/csrattrs` y `/fullcmc` del RFC 7030 **no están implementados** en Lamassu. Un cliente que invoque `/.well-known/est/<DMS_ID>/csrattrs` recibirá `404 Not Found` en lugar del `204 No Content` que el RFC sugiere para \"sin atributos\". Las librerías EST estrictas deben configurarse para no intentar `csrattrs`."},"1302":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/platform/pki/est-enrollment-241","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/platform/pki/est-enrollment","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/platform/pki/est-enrollment#notas-de-compatibilidad","content":"El base64 de la respuesta de `/cacerts` y `/simpleenroll` se trocea en líneas de **76 caracteres** terminadas con CRLF (conforme con S/MIME, RFC 5751). Las partes de `/serverkeygen` no aplican wrap."},"1303":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/platform/pki/est-enrollment-242","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/platform/pki/est-enrollment","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/platform/pki/est-enrollment#notas-de-compatibilidad","content":"El boundary del `multipart/mixed` en `/serverkeygen` está fijado y no se puede negociar."},"1304":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/platform/pki/est-enrollment-243","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/platform/pki/est-enrollment","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/platform/pki/est-enrollment#notas-de-compatibilidad","content":"El segmento `{aps}` es **obligatorio** en todas las rutas EST. Las rutas registradas sin `{aps}` están en el código pero responden `400`."},"1305":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/platform/pki/est-enrollment-244","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/platform/pki/est-enrollment","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/platform/pki/est-enrollment#notas-de-compatibilidad","content":"El cuerpo de `/cacerts`, `/simpleenroll` y `/simplereenroll` puede devolverse como PEM concatenado si el cliente envía `Accept: application/x-pem-file`. Esta es una extensión específica de Lamassu y no aparece en el RFC."},"1306":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/platform/pki/est-enrollment-245","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/platform/pki/est-enrollment","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/platform/pki/est-enrollment#notas-de-compatibilidad","content":"El servidor no rechaza explícitamente CSRs firmados con SHA-1 o MD5; el integrador debe generar el CSR con SHA-256 o superior."},"1307":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/platform/pki/est-enrollment-246","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/platform/pki/est-enrollment","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/platform/pki/est-enrollment#notas-de-compatibilidad","content":"<Card title=\"Visión general del DMS\" href=\"/docs/platform/pki/device-enrollment\" />"},"1308":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/platform/pki/est-enrollment-247","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/platform/pki/est-enrollment","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/platform/pki/est-enrollment#notas-de-compatibilidad","content":"<Card title=\"Validación OCSP\" href=\"/docs/platform/pki/ocsp\" />"},"1309":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/platform/pki/est-enrollment-248","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/platform/pki/est-enrollment","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/platform/pki/est-enrollment#notas-de-compatibilidad","content":"<Card title=\"Gestionar dispositivos\" href=\"/docs/platform/pki/device-management\" />"},"1310":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/platform/pki/integrations/aws-iot-core","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/platform/pki/integrations/aws-iot-core","type":"page","content":"AWS IoT Core","breadcrumbs":["Docs","Plataforma","Integraciones"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/platform/pki/integrations/aws-iot-core"},"1311":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/platform/pki/integrations/aws-iot-core-0","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/platform/pki/integrations/aws-iot-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/platform/pki/integrations/aws-iot-core","content":"El conector de Lamassu para AWS IoT Core sincroniza las identidades de los dispositivos con la plataforma AWS, gestionando el registro de CAs, el aprovisionamiento de Things y el ciclo de vida de los certificados de forma automática y orientada a eventos."},"1312":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/platform/pki/integrations/aws-iot-core-1","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/platform/pki/integrations/aws-iot-core","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/platform/pki/integrations/aws-iot-core#arquitectura-del-conector","content":"Arquitectura del conector"},"1313":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/platform/pki/integrations/aws-iot-core-2","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/platform/pki/integrations/aws-iot-core","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/platform/pki/integrations/aws-iot-core#prerrequisitos","content":"Prerrequisitos"},"1314":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/platform/pki/integrations/aws-iot-core-3","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/platform/pki/integrations/aws-iot-core","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/platform/pki/integrations/aws-iot-core#permisos-iam-necesarios","content":"Permisos IAM necesarios"},"1315":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/platform/pki/integrations/aws-iot-core-4","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/platform/pki/integrations/aws-iot-core","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/platform/pki/integrations/aws-iot-core#parámetros-de-configuración","content":"Parámetros de configuración"},"1316":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/platform/pki/integrations/aws-iot-core-5","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/platform/pki/integrations/aws-iot-core","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/platform/pki/integrations/aws-iot-core#registro-de-la-ca-en-aws-iot-core","content":"Registro de la CA en AWS IoT Core"},"1317":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/platform/pki/integrations/aws-iot-core-6","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/platform/pki/integrations/aws-iot-core","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/platform/pki/integrations/aws-iot-core#cómo-solicitar-el-registro","content":"Cómo solicitar el registro"},"1318":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/platform/pki/integrations/aws-iot-core-7","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/platform/pki/integrations/aws-iot-core","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/platform/pki/integrations/aws-iot-core#primary-account","content":"Primary Account"},"1319":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/platform/pki/integrations/aws-iot-core-8","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/platform/pki/integrations/aws-iot-core","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/platform/pki/integrations/aws-iot-core#secondary-account-sni-only","content":"Secondary Account (SNI-only)"},"1320":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/platform/pki/integrations/aws-iot-core-9","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/platform/pki/integrations/aws-iot-core","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/platform/pki/integrations/aws-iot-core#configuración-del-dms","content":"Configuración del DMS"},"1321":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/platform/pki/integrations/aws-iot-core-10","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/platform/pki/integrations/aws-iot-core","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/platform/pki/integrations/aws-iot-core#modo-none","content":"Modo `none`"},"1322":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/platform/pki/integrations/aws-iot-core-11","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/platform/pki/integrations/aws-iot-core","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/platform/pki/integrations/aws-iot-core#modo-auto","content":"Modo `auto`"},"1323":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/platform/pki/integrations/aws-iot-core-12","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/platform/pki/integrations/aws-iot-core","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/platform/pki/integrations/aws-iot-core#modo-jitp","content":"Modo `jitp`"},"1324":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/platform/pki/integrations/aws-iot-core-13","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/platform/pki/integrations/aws-iot-core","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/platform/pki/integrations/aws-iot-core#aprovisionamiento-de-dispositivos-modo-automático","content":"Aprovisionamiento de dispositivos (modo automático)"},"1325":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/platform/pki/integrations/aws-iot-core-14","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/platform/pki/integrations/aws-iot-core","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/platform/pki/integrations/aws-iot-core#aprovisionamiento-de-dispositivos-modo-jitp","content":"Aprovisionamiento de dispositivos (modo JITP)"},"1326":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/platform/pki/integrations/aws-iot-core-15","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/platform/pki/integrations/aws-iot-core","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/platform/pki/integrations/aws-iot-core#sincronización-del-estado-del-certificado","content":"Sincronización del estado del certificado"},"1327":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/platform/pki/integrations/aws-iot-core-16","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/platform/pki/integrations/aws-iot-core","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/platform/pki/integrations/aws-iot-core#desconexión-forzada-al-revocar","content":"Desconexión forzada al revocar"},"1328":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/platform/pki/integrations/aws-iot-core-17","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/platform/pki/integrations/aws-iot-core","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/platform/pki/integrations/aws-iot-core#device-shadow-y-automatización","content":"Device Shadow y automatización"},"1329":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/platform/pki/integrations/aws-iot-core-18","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/platform/pki/integrations/aws-iot-core","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/platform/pki/integrations/aws-iot-core#qué-escribe-el-conector-en-el-shadow","content":"Qué escribe el conector en el shadow"},"1330":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/platform/pki/integrations/aws-iot-core-19","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/platform/pki/integrations/aws-iot-core","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/platform/pki/integrations/aws-iot-core#políticas-de-aws-iot","content":"Políticas de AWS IoT"},"1331":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/platform/pki/integrations/aws-iot-core-20","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/platform/pki/integrations/aws-iot-core","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/platform/pki/integrations/aws-iot-core#solución-de-problemas","content":"Solución de problemas"},"1332":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/platform/pki/integrations/aws-iot-core-21","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/platform/pki/integrations/aws-iot-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/platform/pki/integrations/aws-iot-core","content":"La integración de Lamassu con AWS IoT Core cubre el puente entre la PKI gestionada por Lamassu y la plataforma de conectividad de AWS. Cuando un dispositivo obtiene su certificado a través del proceso de enrolamiento EST, el conector se encarga de que ese certificado y la identidad asociada sean reconocidos en AWS IoT Core sin intervención manual. El resultado es que el dispositivo puede autenticarse directamente en AWS con el mismo certificado X.509 que Lamassu emitió."},"1333":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/platform/pki/integrations/aws-iot-core-22","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/platform/pki/integrations/aws-iot-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/platform/pki/integrations/aws-iot-core","content":"Desde el punto de vista del protocolo, el dispositivo se autentica ante AWS IoT Core mediante TLS mutuo (mTLS): presenta su certificado X.509 emitido por Lamassu como certificado de cliente, y AWS IoT Core verifica la cadena de certificados hasta llegar a la CA registrada en la cuenta. Lamassu actúa como autoridad de certificación (CA); el conector se encarga de que esa CA esté registrada en AWS y de que el certificado del dispositivo sea conocido por la plataforma antes de que el dispositivo intente conectarse (en modo `auto`) o en su primera conexión (en modo JITP)."},"1334":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/platform/pki/integrations/aws-iot-core-23","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/platform/pki/integrations/aws-iot-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/platform/pki/integrations/aws-iot-core","content":"Este documento está dirigido tanto al administrador PKI, que necesita configurar el conector y registrar las CAs, como al desarrollador de firmware de dispositivos, que necesita entender cómo se nombran los Things, cómo funciona el Device Shadow y qué ocurre cuando un certificado se revoca. Para el desarrollador de firmware, el dato más importante es que el **nombre del Thing en AWS (ThingName) corresponde siempre al Common Name (CN) del certificado emitido por Lamassu**, independientemente del modo de aprovisionamiento."},"1335":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/platform/pki/integrations/aws-iot-core-24","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/platform/pki/integrations/aws-iot-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/platform/pki/integrations/aws-iot-core#arquitectura-del-conector","content":"El conector de AWS IoT Core es un proceso Go independiente, un binario o contenedor separado del núcleo de Lamassu. En un despliegue monolítico se compila por defecto (etiqueta de compilación `!noaws`) y se activa mediante `aws_iot_manager.enabled: true` en el fichero de configuración. En despliegues distribuidos, se ejecuta como un contenedor propio con acceso a los servicios de CA, DMS Manager y Device Manager de Lamassu a través de HTTP."},"1336":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/platform/pki/integrations/aws-iot-core-25","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/platform/pki/integrations/aws-iot-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/platform/pki/integrations/aws-iot-core#arquitectura-del-conector","content":"El conector no sondea los servicios de Lamassu periódicamente. En su lugar, **se suscribe al bus de eventos interno** de Lamassu (AMQP o AWS SQS/SNS, configurable) y reacciona a los eventos que le interesan: creación o actualización de CAs, creación o actualización de DMS, vinculación de identidad de dispositivo, cambio de estado de certificado, actualización de metadatos de certificado y actualización de metadatos de dispositivo. Este modelo orientado a eventos garantiza que la sincronización con AWS sea casi inmediata y no genere carga de sondeo."},"1337":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/platform/pki/integrations/aws-iot-core-26","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/platform/pki/integrations/aws-iot-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/platform/pki/integrations/aws-iot-core#arquitectura-del-conector","content":"Para evitar bucles infinitos, el conector ignora cualquier evento cuyo campo `source` de CloudEvent coincida con su propia URI de origen. Esto previene que las escrituras de metadatos que el propio conector realiza vuelvan a disparar el mismo flujo."},"1338":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/platform/pki/integrations/aws-iot-core-27","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/platform/pki/integrations/aws-iot-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/platform/pki/integrations/aws-iot-core#arquitectura-del-conector","content":"Cuando se ejecutan varios conectores en paralelo, por ejemplo, para distintas cuentas de AWS, cada instancia tiene su propio `connector_id`. Todos los metadatos que el conector escribe en Lamassu se almacenan bajo la clave `lamassu.io/iot/{connector_id}`, lo que permite coexistencia sin colisiones."},"1339":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/platform/pki/integrations/aws-iot-core-28","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/platform/pki/integrations/aws-iot-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/platform/pki/integrations/aws-iot-core#prerrequisitos","content":"Antes de activar el conector es necesario disponer de una cuenta AWS con los permisos IAM adecuados y tener el conector correctamente configurado. El proceso de despliegue (Docker Compose, Kubernetes o binario) se describe en la documentación de despliegue."},"1340":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/platform/pki/integrations/aws-iot-core-29","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/platform/pki/integrations/aws-iot-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/platform/pki/integrations/aws-iot-core#permisos-iam-necesarios","content":"La identidad IAM con la que opera el conector debe tener al mínimo los siguientes permisos sobre los recursos de la cuenta destino:"},"1341":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/platform/pki/integrations/aws-iot-core-30","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/platform/pki/integrations/aws-iot-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/platform/pki/integrations/aws-iot-core#permisos-iam-necesarios","content":"Acción IAM"},"1342":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/platform/pki/integrations/aws-iot-core-31","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/platform/pki/integrations/aws-iot-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/platform/pki/integrations/aws-iot-core#permisos-iam-necesarios","content":"Propósito"},"1343":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/platform/pki/integrations/aws-iot-core-32","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/platform/pki/integrations/aws-iot-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/platform/pki/integrations/aws-iot-core#permisos-iam-necesarios","content":"`iot:GetRegistrationCode`"},"1344":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/platform/pki/integrations/aws-iot-core-33","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr