url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/platform/pki/ocsp"},"1617":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/platform/pki/ocsp-0","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/platform/pki/ocsp","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/platform/pki/ocsp","content":"Consulta en tiempo real si un certificado sigue vigente o se ha revocado."},"1618":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/platform/pki/ocsp-1","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/platform/pki/ocsp","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/platform/pki/ocsp#servicio-ocsp","content":"Servicio OCSP"},"1619":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/platform/pki/ocsp-2","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/platform/pki/ocsp","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/platform/pki/ocsp#cómo-funciona-el-respondedor-en-lamassu","content":"Cómo funciona el respondedor en Lamassu"},"1620":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/platform/pki/ocsp-3","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/platform/pki/ocsp","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/platform/pki/ocsp#enlace-en-los-certificados-emitidos","content":"Enlace en los certificados emitidos"},"1621":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/platform/pki/ocsp-4","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/platform/pki/ocsp","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/platform/pki/ocsp#endpoints-http","content":"Endpoints HTTP"},"1622":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/platform/pki/ocsp-5","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/platform/pki/ocsp","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/platform/pki/ocsp#comprobación-desde-la-interfaz","content":"Comprobación desde la interfaz"},"1623":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/platform/pki/ocsp-6","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/platform/pki/ocsp","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/platform/pki/ocsp#referencias","content":"Referencias"},"1624":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/platform/pki/ocsp-7","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/platform/pki/ocsp","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/platform/pki/ocsp#servicio-ocsp","content":"OCSP (Online Certificate Status Protocol) es el mecanismo que permite a una parte que confía comprobar, en tiempo real, si un certificado concreto está vigente o ha sido revocado. En lugar de descargar una lista completa de certificados revocados, el cliente envía una consulta con el número de serie del certificado y recibe una respuesta firmada con el estado actual."},"1625":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/platform/pki/ocsp-8","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/platform/pki/ocsp","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/platform/pki/ocsp#servicio-ocsp","content":"Lamassu integra un respondedor OCSP propio que atiende estas consultas consultando directamente la base de datos interna de certificados. No se requiere ningún componente externo."},"1626":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/platform/pki/ocsp-9","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/platform/pki/ocsp","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/platform/pki/ocsp#cómo-funciona-el-respondedor-en-lamassu","content":"Cuando un cliente solicita el estado de un certificado, el respondedor localiza el certificado por su número de serie y determina su estado según el registro interno:"},"1627":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/platform/pki/ocsp-10","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/platform/pki/ocsp","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/platform/pki/ocsp#cómo-funciona-el-respondedor-en-lamassu","content":"Si el certificado está activo, la respuesta indica `Good`."},"1628":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/platform/pki/ocsp-11","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/platform/pki/ocsp","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/platform/pki/ocsp#cómo-funciona-el-respondedor-en-lamassu","content":"Si el certificado ha sido revocado, la respuesta indica `Revoked` e incluye la marca de tiempo de revocación y el código de razón conforme a RFC 5280."},"1629":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/platform/pki/ocsp-12","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/platform/pki/ocsp","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/platform/pki/ocsp#cómo-funciona-el-respondedor-en-lamassu","content":"Si el número de serie no se encuentra o el estado no es reconocible, la respuesta indica `Unknown`."},"1630":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/platform/pki/ocsp-13","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/platform/pki/ocsp","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/platform/pki/ocsp#cómo-funciona-el-respondedor-en-lamassu","content":"La respuesta OCSP es firmada por la CA emisora del certificado consultado, utilizando el motor criptográfico asociado a esa CA. Lamassu no utiliza un certificado delegado de firma OCSP: la CA actúa directamente como respondedor."},"1631":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/platform/pki/ocsp-14","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/platform/pki/ocsp","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/platform/pki/ocsp#cómo-funciona-el-respondedor-en-lamassu","content":"Cada respuesta tiene una ventana de validez de 24 horas, reflejada en los campos `thisUpdate` y `nextUpdate` de la respuesta. Los clientes que cacheen respuestas deben tener en cuenta esta ventana al determinar durante cuánto tiempo una respuesta sigue siendo válida."},"1632":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/platform/pki/ocsp-15","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/platform/pki/ocsp","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/platform/pki/ocsp#enlace-en-los-certificados-emitidos","content":"La URL del respondedor OCSP se incorpora automáticamente en la extensión AIA (*Authority Information Access*) de todos los certificados emitidos por Lamassu. Los clientes que verifican certificados pueden leer esta URL directamente del certificado sin necesidad de configuración adicional."},"1633":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/platform/pki/ocsp-16","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/platform/pki/ocsp","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/platform/pki/ocsp#endpoints-http","content":"El respondedor acepta los dos formatos definidos en RFC 6960:"},"1634":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/platform/pki/ocsp-17","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/platform/pki/ocsp","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/platform/pki/ocsp#endpoints-http","content":"`GET /ocsp/{ocsp_request}` incluye la petición OCSP codificada en Base64url dentro de la propia URL."},"1635":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/platform/pki/ocsp-18","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/platform/pki/ocsp","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/platform/pki/ocsp#endpoints-http","content":"`POST /ocsp` envía la petición en el cuerpo con `Content-Type: application/ocsp-request`."},"1636":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/platform/pki/ocsp-19","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/platform/pki/ocsp","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/platform/pki/ocsp#endpoints-http","content":"Ejemplo de consulta con `curl` mediante POST:"},"1637":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/platform/pki/ocsp-20","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/platform/pki/ocsp","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/platform/pki/ocsp#endpoints-http","content":"La respuesta tiene `Content-Type: application/ocsp-response` y contiene la respuesta OCSP en formato DER."},"1638":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/platform/pki/ocsp-21","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/platform/pki/ocsp","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/platform/pki/ocsp#comprobación-desde-la-interfaz","content":"Desde la pantalla de certificados de Lamassu es posible lanzar una petición OCSP directamente sobre el certificado seleccionado mediante la acción **OCSP Check**. Esta acción muestra el estado devuelto por el respondedor sin necesidad de herramientas externas."},"1639":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/platform/pki/ocsp-22","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/platform/pki/ocsp","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/platform/pki/ocsp#referencias","content":"RFC 6960 - *X.509 Internet Public Key Infrastructure Online Certificate Status Protocol – OCSP*"},"1640":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/platform/pki/ocsp-23","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/platform/pki/ocsp","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/platform/pki/ocsp#referencias","content":"RFC 5280 - *Internet X.509 Public Key Infrastructure Certificate and Certificate Revocation List (CRL) Profile* (razones de revocación, sección 5.3.1)"},"1641":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/platform/pki/ocsp-24","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/platform/pki/ocsp","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/platform/pki/ocsp#referencias","content":"<Card title=\"Servicio CRL\" href=\"/docs/platform/pki/crl\" />"},"1642":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/platform/pki/ocsp-25","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/platform/pki/ocsp","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/platform/pki/ocsp#referencias","content":"<Card title=\"Validación de certificados\" href=\"/docs/platform/pki/certificate-validation\" />"},"1643":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/platform/pki/overview","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/platform/pki/overview","type":"page","content":"Plataforma Lamassu IoT","breadcrumbs":["Docs","Plataforma"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/platform/pki/overview"},"1644":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/platform/pki/overview-0","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/platform/pki/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/platform/pki/overview","content":"Gestiona la PKI y las identidades digitales de tus dispositivos desde una única plataforma."},"1645":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/platform/pki/overview-1","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/platform/pki/overview","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/platform/pki/overview#empieza-aquí","content":"Empieza aquí"},"1646":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/platform/pki/overview-2","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/platform/pki/overview","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/platform/pki/overview#capacidades-principales","content":"Capacidades principales"},"1647":{"id":"