t":"Configura clave y usos"},"1706":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate-6","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate#emite-y-descarga","content":"Emite y descarga"},"1707":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate-7","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate#verifica-el-resultado","content":"Verifica el resultado"},"1708":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate-8","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate#siguiente-paso","content":"Siguiente paso"},"1709":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate-9","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate","content":"En este quickstart Lamassu generará la clave y el CSR en el navegador, y la CA emitirá el certificado. Al terminar descargarás el certificado y su clave privada."},"1710":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate-10","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate#antes-de-empezar","content":"Una CA activa con permiso para emitir certificados."},"1711":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate-11","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate#antes-de-empezar","content":"Un nombre para la identidad, por ejemplo `device-001.example.internal`."},"1712":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate-12","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate#antes-de-empezar","content":"Un lugar seguro en el que custodiar la clave privada descargada."},"1713":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate-13","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate#antes-de-empezar","content":"En este flujo la clave se genera en el navegador y Lamassu no la almacena. Descárgala y protégela antes de cerrar el resultado de la operación."},"1714":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate-14","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate#inicia-la-emisión","content":"Abre la CA creada en el quickstart anterior, entra en **Issued Certificates** y selecciona **Issue New**."},"1715":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate-15","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate#elige-el-método","content":"Selecciona **Generate Key & CSR in Browser**. Usa **Upload Existing CSR** cuando la clave privada deba generarse y permanecer en el sistema de destino."},"1716":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate-16","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate#identifica-el-certificado","content":"Introduce el `Common Name` y, si corresponde, la organización, unidad organizativa y ubicación. Añade SANs para cada nombre DNS, dirección IP, correo o URI con el que se vaya a validar la identidad."},"1717":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate-17","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate#configura-clave-y-usos","content":"Elige RSA o ECDSA, define la validez y selecciona los usos de clave. Para una identidad de dispositivo que usa mTLS, habilita **Digital Signature** y **Client Authentication**."},"1718":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate-18","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate#configura-clave-y-usos","content":"La validez no puede superar la fecha de expiración de la CA emisora."},"1719":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate-19","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate#emite-y-descarga","content":"Confirma la emisión y descarga inmediatamente el certificado y la clave privada en formato PEM."},"1720":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate-20","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate#verifica-el-resultado","content":"El certificado debe aparecer en **Issued Certificates** con estado activo. Comprueba su sujeto, SANs, emisor, usos y periodo de validez."},"1721":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate-21","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/p