o","content":"OCSP o CRL no reflejan un cambio"},"1768":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/platform/pki/troubleshooting-14","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/platform/pki/troubleshooting","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/platform/pki/troubleshooting#los-eventos-no-llegan","content":"Los eventos no llegan"},"1769":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/platform/pki/troubleshooting-15","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/platform/pki/troubleshooting","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/platform/pki/troubleshooting#observabilidad","content":"Observabilidad"},"1770":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/platform/pki/troubleshooting-16","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/platform/pki/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/platform/pki/troubleshooting","content":"Empieza por localizar la capa que falla. Una respuesta del Gateway, un pod no preparado y una emisión rechazada pueden parecer el mismo problema desde la consola, pero requieren evidencias distintas."},"1771":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/platform/pki/troubleshooting-17","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/platform/pki/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/platform/pki/troubleshooting#reproduce-una-sola-operación","content":"Anota hora en UTC, usuario o principal, recurso, endpoint y resultado. Evita repetir una acción destructiva como revocación o eliminación."},"1772":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/platform/pki/troubleshooting-18","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/platform/pki/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/platform/pki/troubleshooting#separa-cliente-gateway-y-servicio","content":"Comprueba el código HTTP. Un 401 apunta a autenticación; un 403, a autorización; un 404, a ruta o recurso; un 5xx, al servicio o una dependencia."},"1773":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/platform/pki/troubleshooting-19","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/platform/pki/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/do